sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant CLI
    participant API
    participant DB
    participant Cache as Redis

    User->>CLI: run query
    CLI->>API: GET /items?q=foo
    API->>Cache: lookup "foo"
    alt cache hit
        Cache-->>API: cached payload
    else cache miss
        API->>DB: SELECT * FROM items WHERE ...
        DB-->>API: rows
        API->>Cache: store "foo" (TTL 60s)
    end
    API-->>CLI: JSON payload
    CLI-->>User: rendered table
